OL,3,GNEWSA'Foul smell' and 'grey substance'
OL,4,Aflowing in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grey substance in a river accompanied
OL,7,Fby a bad smell has been reported by a
OL,8,Fdog walker.
OL,10,FBethanne Reed was by the River Eden, in
OL,11,FAppleby, when she came across "grey,
OL,12,Fmilky discharge" and an "obvious foul
OL,13,Fsmell" near the Jubilee Bridge on
OL,14,FMonday morning.
OL,16,FShe said her dog "loves a swim" and "it
OL,17,Fwas a job to keep her out when she saw
OL,18,Fthe spill", adding similar spills "seem
OL,19,Fto be happening too frequently".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
